WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.698
Hi, I’m Agastya Kommanamanchi, a forward-deployed engineer who turns ambitious AI, data, and cloud priorities into secure systems that ship.

00:00:10.698 --> 00:00:23.807
For more than a decade, I’ve built enterprise platforms—from recommendations serving more than 50 million users to generative AI workflows achieving over 95 percent task success.

00:00:23.807 --> 00:00:29.432
I love forward-deployed engineering because it keeps me close to the real problem.

00:00:29.432 --> 00:00:38.784
I sit with users, understand the workflow, make architecture tangible, and stay accountable from prototype through production and adoption.

00:00:38.784 --> 00:00:44.317
I bring hands-on engineering, product judgment, and executive communication.

00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:51.643
If you’re building high-impact enterprise AI, I’d love to help turn the idea into a measurable outcome.
